Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.18,0:21:38.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.14,0:21:40.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是外星科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's alien technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.05,0:21:44.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你带我来是想让我看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what you brought me here to see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.40,0:21:47.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.84,0:21:50.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能  我能看看吗  能接触吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I... Can I see this? Can I get into this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.71,0:21:51.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.50,0:21:53.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.47,0:22:08.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-一切都好吧  -是的  长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Everything good? - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.39,0:22:10.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.61,0:22:13.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布拉克特博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Brackett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.30,0:22:16.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想来见一见掠夺者吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like to meet a Predator?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.74,0:22:18.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
