Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.10,0:22:29.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,净化操作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}decontamination protocol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.62,0:22:32.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是怎么说服你前来帮忙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, how'd they rope you into this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.93,0:22:34.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我6岁时给总统写了一封信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wrote a letter to the president when I was six.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.15,0:22:36.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他我有多喜欢动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Told him how much I loved animals,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.59,0:22:38.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是航空航天局发现了外星动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that if NASA ever found a space animal,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.41,0:22:39.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望他们能给我打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they should call me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.11,0:22:42.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几年前我因为一篇杂交菌株的论文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couple years ago, I was put on a short list{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.77,0:22:44.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上了候选人名单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a paper I wrote on hybrid strains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.81,0:22:48.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电脑对照参照了那封信  我就来这儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computer cross-referenced the letter, and... here I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.91,0:22:57.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布拉克特博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Brackett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.17,0:22:59.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢前来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.70,0:23:00.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信你心里一定充满了疑问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you have questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.31,0:23:03.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-其实只有两个问题  -好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh. Just two, actually. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.31,0:23:05.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你叫它"掠夺者"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you call it "The Predator"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.57,0:23:08.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一个昵称\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a nickname.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.84,0:23:11.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,数据显示它会追捕猎物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, the data suggests that it tracks its prey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.80,0:23:13.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利用猎物的弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exploits weakness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.41,0:23:14.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它看起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seems to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.41,0:23:16.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乐在其中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well, enjoy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.76,0:23:18.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像是在玩游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.19,0:23:20.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是掠夺者  而是娱乐猎人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not a predator, that's a sports hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.20,0:23:21.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.33,0:23:23.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,掠夺者捕猎只是为了生存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A predator kills its prey to survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.68,0:23:27.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你形容的就像是捕鲈鱼的渔夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, what you're describing is more like a bass fisherman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.55,0:23:29.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们投票表决了  掠夺者听起来更酷  对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we took a vote. Predator's cooler, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.51,0:23:31.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-对极了  -对极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fuck yeah. - Fuck yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.68,0:23:33.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在墨西哥发现了它的逃生舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Found his escape pod in Mexico.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.60,0:23:35.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还在找它开来的飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still looking for the ship he came in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.12,0:23:37.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它已经深度麻醉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's heavily sedated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.39,0:23:45.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个美丽的混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are one beautiful motherfucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.74,0:23:49.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你的第二个问题是为什么找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna guess your second question is, why are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.70,0:23:54.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的检测结果有一些...奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our test results yielded something a little... odd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.62,0:23:58.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个玩笑吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this a joke?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.84,0:24:00.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们做了十次基因组序列\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We ran the genome sequence ten times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.06,0:24:02.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个外星人有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This specimen has...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.98,0:24:04.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-人类的基因  -没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Human DNA? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.67,0:24:05.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.98,0:24:08.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道物种会自发形成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, we know about spontaneous speciation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.72,0:24:10.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大多数植物和昆虫都是这样  但是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mostly plants and insects, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.33,0:24:12.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是一些哺乳动物  绵羊  山羊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But some mammals, sheep, goats, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.99,0:24:13.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.25,0:24:15.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红狼是众所周知的混血动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The red wolf is known to be a hybrid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.73,0:24:16.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是由土狼和灰狼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}between the coyote and the grey wolf...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.08,0:24:19.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者可能是某种形式的重组技术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or possibly some form of recombinant technology...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.43,0:24:21.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位  各位  各位  我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, guys, guys. I get it, I get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.52,0:24:24.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想知道是不是有人操了外星人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna know if someone fucked an alien?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.65,0:24:27.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.22,0:24:32.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它戴了大气面罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, it's got some kind of atmospheric mask,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.66,0:24:33.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生物气密罩  还有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}biohelmet, and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.09,0:24:35.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些是什么  护腕吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are these? Like, some kind of wrist gauntlets?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.01,0:24:37.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.79,0:24:39.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那头盔和还有一只护腕呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, where's the helmet and the other gauntlet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.97,0:24:40.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我们  已经到处都找过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've looked, believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.63,0:24:44.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.67,0:24:47.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是一个接触掠夺者的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He made first contact with the Predator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.67,0:24:49.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  我要找他谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. I'd like to talk to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.89,0:24:52.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他正在接受评估  所以...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he's being evaluated, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.90,0:24:56.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.07,0:24:58.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你们给他做脑叶切断术之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, before you lobotomize him,{\r}
