Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.21,0:25:06.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到  目的地是哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Read you five-by-five. Destination?{\r}
