Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.96,0:25:10.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时会有军队人员接应  完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be met by military personnel. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.57,0:25:13.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴克斯利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Baxley!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.31,0:25:15.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个问题问你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Question for ya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.53,0:25:16.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.96,0:25:18.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要怎么样才能给一个流浪汉割包皮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you circumcise a homeless man?{\r}
