Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.67,0:25:27.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-都他妈给我闭嘴  -好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shut the fuck up! - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.76,0:25:28.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你他妈给我闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shut the fuck up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.98,0:25:33.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  好了  玩笑开过头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, hold on, hold on. Y'all going too fucking much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.59,0:25:35.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想知道这个混蛋是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanna know who this motherfucker is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.81,0:25:36.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是为什么进来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.60,0:25:41.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样  这里一车都是疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man, this is the loony bus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.77,0:25:43.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-瞧瞧这个混蛋  -都是疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look at this motherfucker. - Loonies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.43,0:25:44.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loonies, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.69,0:25:48.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟外星人打了一架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a run-in with a space alien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.04,0:25:51.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.48,0:25:54.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不  让他  -他赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, let him... - Okay, that guy wins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.74,0:25:55.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听到过的最棒的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the best story I've ever heard.{\r}
