Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.31,1:34:57.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut the fuck up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.90,1:35:19.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的小队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My unit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.60,1:35:22.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈特尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nettles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.99,1:35:26.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,柯伊尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coyle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.78,1:35:30.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也看到林奇的牌了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you saw Lynch's card.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.09,1:35:35.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴克斯利一直带着这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baxley had this the whole time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.44,1:35:39.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,内布拉斯加的坏习惯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nebraska's bad habit.{\r}
