Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.88,1:35:45.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是一群不会被任何人知晓的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}these are the ones that no one's gonna remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.23,1:35:47.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.32,1:35:49.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们让他们安息吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you say we put them to rest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.93,1:36:35.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦肯纳上尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain McKenna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.15,1:36:39.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是山田由弘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hiroshi Yamada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.42,1:36:41.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-先生  -首先\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir. - First things first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.50,1:36:43.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想谢谢你栽培出这么优秀的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to say thank you for having such a great kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.64,1:36:44.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他很喜欢这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He loves it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.03,1:36:46.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他很特别  怎么样了  医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he's something else. What do we got, Doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.86,1:36:48.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你现在应该知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I assume that you know by now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.34,1:36:51.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一位掠夺者不是来这里猎杀我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the first Predator, it didn't come here to hunt us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.21,1:36:53.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他带来了一些东西  -没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He brought something. - Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.13,1:36:55.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想听好消息吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you want to hear the good news?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.82,1:36:58.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送来的东西完好无损\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cargo survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.04,1:37:00.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,某种自动防故障装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With some sort of fail-safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.74,1:37:02.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在强化版铁血战至炸掉飞船之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before the upgrade Predator blew up the ship,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.05,1:37:04.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一架救生舱脱离了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a pod escaped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.35,1:37:05.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弹射出去  保住了那东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jettisoned. Saved itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.14,1:37:10.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来他不想冒任何风险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems that our boy wasn't taking any chances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.01,1:37:13.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就想把这个交到我们手上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wanted us to have this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.81,1:37:28.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在这里干什么的来着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it again you do here, exactly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.55,1:37:32.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是全世界头号神经机械学权威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the world's number one authority on cybernetics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.34,1:37:35.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, kiddo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.04,1:37:39.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很棒吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty cool, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.26,1:37:40.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很棒  你都有自己的办公桌了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty cool. You got your own desk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.65,1:37:42.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会告诉妈妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll make sure to tell Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.39,1:37:46.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是他送给人类的礼物吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, this is his gift to humankind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.02,1:38:04.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-后退  -小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get back! - Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.02,1:38:06.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人  后退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone, stand back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.59,1:38:07.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后退  赶紧疏散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand back! Clear the area!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.21,1:38:15.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸  舱体给我发了一则信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, the pod sent me a message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.43,1:38:20.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-罗利  舱体里有什么  -不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rory, what's in that pod? - Don't know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.13,1:38:23.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, wow... Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.74,1:38:25.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-它有名字  -名字  什么名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's got a name! - Name? What name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.83,1:38:27.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得应该要叫做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess you'd call it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.74,1:38:29.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,掠夺者杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Predator Killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.61,1:38:31.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-带他离开这里  -跟着我  快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get him out of here! - Come with me. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.09,1:38:34.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后退  疏散区域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back. Clear the area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.88,1:38:35.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全体注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyes on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.96,1:39:10.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管这是什么  好像处于休眠期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever it is, it appears to be dormant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.83,1:39:13.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想这应该需要...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assume it needs to be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.18,1:39:15.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意  瞄准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyes on. Keep your weapons trained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.05,1:39:18.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我  拿下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get it off! Get it off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.48,1:39:52.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.35,1:39:54.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的新战服  宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my new suit, bubba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.35,1:39:59.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能伸展到42码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope they got it in a 42 long.{\r}
